{"id":"1e959f58a71a7a2f","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting.md","title":"Type elimination map","display":"df-many-sorted-type-forgetting — Type elimination map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting","aliases":["56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting"],"display":"df-many-sorted-type-forgetting — Type elimination map","depends_on":["[[56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system]]","[[56-df-terms]]","[[56-df-rewrite-system]]"],"source_section":"§6.5.6","source_printed_pages":"256–257","source_ocr_blocks":[277,278],"source_verification":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-sorted-type-forgetting — Type elimination map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f47f83c51f651d3\" href=\"?note=4f47f83c51f651d3\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system\">56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.5.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"256–257"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>277</span><span>278</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\bullet\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\bullet\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_s\">\\(T_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_S\">\\(T_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\">\\(R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f47f83c51f651d3\" href=\"?note=4f47f83c51f651d3\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system\">56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal F&#39;\\)</span> 是函数符号的互不混淆的副本，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal F&#39;\">\\(\\pi:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal F&#39;\\)</span> 为给定双射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F&#39;\\cap\\mathcal V=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathcal F&#39;\\cap\\mathcal V=\\varnothing\\)</span>。自由项构造取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a>；无排序规则族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TRS}\">\\(\\operatorname{TRS}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(f)=(s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\">\\(a(f)=(s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i\\in T_{s_i}\">\\(t_i\\in T_{s_i}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}&#39;:\\mathcal F&#39;\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}&#39;(\\pi(f))\\coloneqq|a(f)|\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ar}&#39;:\\mathcal F&#39;\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}&#39;(\\pi(f))\\coloneqq|a(f)|\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma&#39;\\coloneqq(\\mathcal F&#39;,\\operatorname{ar}&#39;),\\qquad\nT&#39;\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma&#39;,\\mathcal V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma&#39;\\coloneqq(\\mathcal F&#39;,\\operatorname{ar}&#39;),\\qquad\nT&#39;\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma&#39;,\\mathcal V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Theta:T_S\\to T&#39;,\\qquad\\Theta(x)\\coloneqq x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Theta:T_S\\to T&#39;,\\qquad\\Theta(x)\\coloneqq x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Theta(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq\n\\pi(f)(\\Theta(t_1),\\ldots,\\Theta(t_k)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Theta(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq\n\\pi(f)(\\Theta(t_1),\\ldots,\\Theta(t_k)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^{\\Theta}\\coloneqq\\{(\\Theta(l),\\Theta(r))\\mid(l,r)\\in R\\},\\qquad\nR^{\\Theta}\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^{\\Theta}\\coloneqq\\{(\\Theta(l),\\Theta(r))\\mid(l,r)\\in R\\},\\qquad\nR^{\\Theta}\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T&#39;_{\\mathrm{wt}}\\coloneqq\\Theta[T_S].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T&#39;_{\\mathrm{wt}}\\coloneqq\\Theta[T_S].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书使用给函数符号加撇号的记法，本文件用指定双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 表示这一重命名；变量符号不变。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 由有限项结构递归唯一确定，并保持变量出现集合，因而映射后的规则仍满足非变量左项和右侧变量限制。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\Theta}\">\\(R^{\\Theta}\\)</span> 是规则集合的显式映像，不把 term-to-term 函数误当成已定义的规则函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;_{\\mathrm{wt}}\">\\(T&#39;_{\\mathrm{wt}}\\)</span> 是无排序项集中可由排序项得到的子集，通常不是整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;\">\\(T&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§6.5.6，印刷第256–257页，OCR页块277–278。已比对类型消除映射、函数符号副本、变量集并集与规则映像；良定义性及规则侧条件由上述本地结构归纳核对。OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"4f47f83c51f651d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false}